OL,11,G0232 Tech Life
OL,12,     FCloudy lines in the sky, caused by
OL,13,     Faircraft engines, are called
OL,14,     Fcontrails. They're harmful to the
OL,15,     Fenvironment. Now a project is
OL,16,     Funderway, using AI, to reduce the
OL,17,     Famount generated.
